    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38239" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prĕcātus</span></b> ,
		ūs, m.
		precor, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a prayer</i>, <i>request</i> (poet,
			and post-class.), <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 10, 71</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">concordi precatu tentare aliquid,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 24, 6, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dabitur precatui tuo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 8, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">precatibus efficacissimis obtinere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 9, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
